 c Open House 4:30-7pm on Tuesday\, February 25th at Driggs City Hall. <em>O
 r</em> drop-in for a Virtual Q&amp\;A Session at 6pm on Zoom (<a href="http
 s://www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81419251856?pwd%3Df9bpN3
 xibOoHhBkJH8Qe0EdsaoAJaM.1&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=17409484
 56198730&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2bWpLDADfUgjpaga4jAP3M" target="_blank">Click Here 
 to Join </a>).</b></strong></p><p>The open house will be a &quot\;drop-in&q
 uot\; style event with one-on-one Q&amp\;A with the consultant team. The ev
 ent will focus on the Needs Assessment and provide an opportunity to discus
 s and comment on potential transportation improvement projects\, programs o
 r services.</p><p><strong><b>OPEN HOUSE DISPLAY BOARDS:</b></strong></p><ul
 ><li><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://mcclibraryfunctions.azur
 ewebsites.us/api/munidocDownload/31258/7bdc49a500900/pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sou
 rce=calendar&amp\;ust=1740948456198730&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2DU14qJkZWMMa_rXR5CP9
