DESCRIPTION:<u></u><u></u>Join staff\, elected and appointed officials and 
 other community members between 2-4pm or 6-8pm in the City Hall Foyer for i
 nformal (drop-in) discussion of proposed &#39\;first-round&#39\; amendments
  to the Driggs Land Development Code to encourage development of affordable
  and workforce housing in the city.<br><b><br></b><b>FULL DETAILS:</b> <a h
 ref="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://driggsidaho.org/projects/amd22-1&
 amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1647794052360376&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0lZ
 qCGb7h-Hv8e90zPyWwm" target="_blank">https://driggsidaho.org/projects/amd22
 -1</a><br><p><strong><b>PURPOSE: </b></strong>The purpose of the proposed L
 and Development Code Amendment AMD22-1 is to implement recommendations from
  the <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://mcclibraryfunctions.azur
 ewebsites.us/api/munidocDownload/31258/46ab2019ca472/pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sou
 rce=calendar&amp\;ust=1647794052360376&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1WwR-LjvmD93LrKUZFntW
 2" target="_blank">2022 Housing Needs Assessment </a> to address the lack o
 f workforce and affordable housing in the community by creating development
  incentives for workforce and affordable housing and by adding mitigation s
 tandards for consideration during an upzone and/or annexation request. The 
 proposed amendments also implement the <a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://mcclibraryfunctions.azurewebsites.us/api/munidocDownload/31258/46
 e996919737d/pdf&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1647794052360376&am
 p\;usg=AOvVaw00fT0BTpB6LtKa1-mW92XW" target="_blank">2019 Affordable Housin
 g Strategic Plan </a> recommendations.</p><p><br></p><u></u><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220315T163526Z
LOCATION:Driggs City Hall Foyer\, 60 S Main St
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Open House for Driggs Affordable Housing Code Amendments
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
